s="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MOTOI KOJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURANAKA TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURATA TAKUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUO, RYUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MOTOI, KOJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURANAKA, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURATA, TAKUMI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A composite material consisting of a filler and a synthetic resin, comprising a core layer containing a filler weighing at least 0.7 times the product of a volume of the core layer and a bulk density of the filler and a thermosetting resin reinforced by long fibers parallel to each other in a longitudinal direction, wherein a surface layer is provided that is laminated so as to cover at least one face in a thickness direction of the core layer.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un matériau composite se composant d'un agent de remplissage et d'une résine de synthèse. Ce matériau comprend une couche centrale avec un agent de remplissage dont le poids correspond au moins à 0,7 fois le produit d'un volume de la couche centrale et d'un poids volumique apparent de l'agent de remplissage. Ce matériau comprend aussi une résine thermodurcissante renforcée par de longues fibres parallèles les unes aux autres dans un sens longitudinal. Une couche de surface est prévue qui est stratifiée de manière à recouvrir au moins une face dans le sens de l'épaisseur de la couche centrale.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>